                <mxCell id="n148" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EventProposalTask.claim(): mongoEventProposalReviewRepository.claim(), one transaction. An Open&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;EVENT_CANCELLATION task is claimed first; otherwise the newest Open EVENT_PROPOSAL task&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(assigneeId empty or the same officer; 409 &quot;event proposal review is no longer open&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;... is assigned to another officer&quot;, &quot;... was claimed&quot;)&lt;br&gt;EventProposalSummary.startReview(): same transaction, events Pending Approval -&amp;gt; Under Review,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;audit EVENT_PROPOSAL_REVIEW_CLAIMED (409 &quot;event proposal cannot be reviewed in its current state&quot;)&lt;br&gt;EventProposalQueueItem.isReviewable(): listOpen() keeps Open EVENT_PROPOSAL tasks whose event is in&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;reviewableStates and Open EVENT_CANCELLATION tasks whose event is in cancellableStates&lt;br&gt;detail(): task = the Open EVENT_CANCELLATION task when one exists, else the newest EVENT_PROPOSAL task&lt;br&gt;EventProposalDetail.currentVersion() / EventProposalVersion.isCurrentOf(): revisionNo =&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;event.currentRevisionNo, falling back to versions.at(-1) (repository detail(), usecase decide)&lt;br&gt;EventProposalSummary.state is a plain string: &quot;Re-defense Pending&quot; is stored but is not a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ClubEventState literal&lt;br&gt;Errors: officer() 401 &quot;authentication required&quot; / 423 locked / 400 &quot;invalid actor&quot; /&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;403 &quot;ICPDP officer role required&quot;; eventId() 400 &quot;invalid event id&quot;;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;getEventProposalReview 404 &quot;event proposal not found&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proposal document and template&lt;/b&gt;: not part of eventProposalReviewRoutes.&lt;br&gt;GET /admin/event-proposals/:id/document/access and POST /admin/event-proposals/template are&lt;br&gt;mounted in clubEventRoutes -&amp;gt; usecase club-event (reviewEventProposalDocumentAccess,&lt;br&gt;uploadEventProposalTemplate; both reuse officer() of this module) -&amp;gt; ClubEventRepository&lt;br&gt;.proposalDocument(eventId, revisionNo ?? &quot;latest&quot;) / .saveProposalTemplate(); see page 03." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="304" width="600" x="1570" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
