                <mxCell id="n676" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EventReviewDecisionInput.normalize(): usecase normalizedEventDecision() -&amp;gt; NormalizedEventDecision&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(sections typed EventReviewSection[]); a reason is required unless Approve; &quot;Request revision&quot; needs&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;gt;= 1 section and a future revisionDeadlineAt; conditions / budgetLines only for Approve (400)&lt;br&gt;decideEventProposalReview: 404 &quot;event proposal not found&quot;, then mongo decide() -&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;applyProposalDecisionInSession(requireDefendedSession = false) in one transaction:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;409 &quot;event proposal cannot be decided&quot; (event not Under Review | Re-defense Pending, or no Open task&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;assigned to this officer); with an active defense: 400 &quot;revision deadline must be at least 12 hours&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;before the scheduled defense&quot; (assertRevisionDeadlineBeforeDefense); 409 &quot;submitted proposal revision&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;is missing&quot;; 409 &quot;event proposal changed while deciding&quot;&lt;br&gt;EventReviewDecision.nextEventState(): Approve -&amp;gt; Approved, Reject -&amp;gt; Rejected,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Request revision -&amp;gt; Revision Requested, Re-defense -&amp;gt; Re-defense Pending&lt;br&gt;EventProposalSummary.requestRevision(): state + revisionDeadlineAt; bookings Requested / Under Review&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; Revision Requested; audit + notification EVENT_PROPOSAL_REVISION_REQUESTED to version.submittedBy&lt;br&gt;EventProposalSummary.expire(): startEventLifecycleJob (hourly) -&amp;gt; runEventLifecycleJob -&amp;gt; advanceLifecycle():&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;deadline passed -&amp;gt; Expired, active defense sessions CANCELLED; an event with an EVENT_RESCHEDULED audit&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;is first cancelled (cancelEventInSession, PROPOSAL_EXPIRY) then set Expired; audit EVENT_PROPOSAL_EXPIRED,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;notification EVENT_PROPOSAL_EXPIRED to the current version's submitter&lt;br&gt;EventProposalTask.close(): Open -&amp;gt; Decided, closedAt = now" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="265" width="640" x="1390" as="geometry" />
