                <mxCell id="n1206" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ClubEventInput.validate(): domain validateClubEventInput(input, calendar, now) -&amp;gt; semesterCode (title/objective/plan,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a venue or occurrences, occurrences inside the event and not overlapping, budget lines, form field keys)&lt;br&gt;assertProposalAudience(): audienceScope must be PUBLIC (400 &quot;only public event proposals are supported&quot;);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;budgets are optional (budgetLines may be empty); clubEventBody has no riskCategory field&lt;br&gt;ClubEventInput.assertNotice(): domain assertEventNotice(startAt, now, rules.proposalNoticeHours), submit only&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.canResubmit(): mongo act() - save/submit filter __v = expectedVersion (409 &quot;event changed or is not&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;available in this club; reload and retry&quot;); state in {Draft, Revision Requested} and revisionDeadlineAt not&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;passed (409 &quot;event cannot be edited or submitted&quot; / &quot;revision deadline has passed&quot;)&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.submit(): submitVersion() after assess() - 409 &quot;club is not active for event proposals&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;event ends after the dissolution semester&quot;; assertObligations() only when policy.enforceOverdueReportBlock&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(409 &quot;overdue club obligations prevent proposal submission&quot;); submitVersion(): 409 &quot;an event with an approved&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;budget must keep its budget lines when resubmitting&quot;; revisionNo + 1, Pending Approval (an active defense -&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Under Review, task assigned to its lead officer), new eventProposalVersions row, EVENT_PROPOSAL approval task&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;with the UC05 SLA (routedTaskFields), linkEventBookings(), syncProposalSessionBookings(&quot;Under Review&quot;),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;audit EVENT_PROPOSAL_SUBMITTED&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.assertProposalDocumentPresent(): domain assertProposalDocumentPresent(), called by mongo act() for&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kind &quot;submit&quot; only (400 without proposalDocument); submitVersion() freezes the stored document in the payload&lt;br&gt;act(&quot;attach-document&quot;): no expectedVersion, so no __v filter (the update only increments __v); same state and&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;deadline checks; audit EVENT_PROPOSAL_DOCUMENT_UPLOADED. Usecase uploadEventProposalDocument first runs&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;validateEventProposalFile() (PDF or DOCX, &amp;lt;= 10 MB, magic bytes), 400 &quot;internal club events do not take a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;proposal document&quot;, 409 &quot;event cannot be edited or submitted&quot;&lt;br&gt;Template upload / officer document access: officer(deps.auth, actor) from event-proposal-review&lt;br&gt;EventProposalFileStorage: adapter cloudinaryEventProposalFiles (infra/files/event-proposal-files.ts);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;proposalTemplate(): latest EVENT_PROPOSAL_TEMPLATE_UPDATED audit, else the bundled default file&lt;br&gt;mongoClubEventRepository(rules): payloadInSession, assess, assertObligations, submitVersion, linkEventBookings,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;syncProposalSessionBookings are module functions; rules is the factory parameter&lt;br&gt;ClubEventAction.eventActionPermission(): domain function eventActionPermission(action) in club-event.ts&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(&quot;club.attendance.manage&quot; for check-in / unlock, otherwise &quot;club.event.manage&quot;)&lt;br&gt;ClubEventDetail.maskedForAttendance(): inline masking in usecase actOnClubEvent()" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="408" width="690" x="1640" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
