                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="g04_help_o" parent="g04_help" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;rotatable=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" value="+applyProposalDecisionInSession(session, eventId, officerId,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;input, now, options : {requireDefendedSession}) : Promise&amp;lt;void&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;+requestedLines(raw) : RequestedBudgetLine[]&lt;br&gt;+approvedLines(raw) : ApprovedBudgetLine[]&lt;br&gt;+mapDefenseSession(doc) : EventDefenseSession" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="78" width="420" y="66" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n1803" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EventProposalVersion.approvedBudget(): domain approvedBudget(requested, decided) - one entry per line,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;whole and &amp;gt;= 0, &amp;lt;= requested, a reduced line needs a reason; fundingDecision NOT_SPONSORED =&amp;gt; 0,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;BEFORE_EVENT / AFTER_EVENT =&amp;gt; the full requested amount (400). The usecase pre-checks it and&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;applyProposalDecisionInSession() rechecks it inside the transaction&lt;br&gt;EventReviewDecision.nextEventState(): Approve -&amp;gt; Approved (approvalConditions = conditions),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Reject -&amp;gt; Rejected, Re-defense -&amp;gt; Re-defense Pending (new Open task for the same officer),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Request revision -&amp;gt; Revision Requested; audit + notification EVENT_PROPOSAL_&amp;lt;NEXT_STATE&amp;gt; with&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;spaces as &quot;_&quot;: EVENT_PROPOSAL_APPROVED, _REJECTED, _RE-DEFENSE_PENDING, _REVISION_REQUESTED&lt;br&gt;Approve: event bookings -&amp;gt; Approved after property checks (409 &quot;active property not found&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;property is blacked out during the event&quot;, &quot;event schedule has blocking conflicts&quot;)&lt;br&gt;Reject: releaseFacilityBookingsInSession(PROPOSAL_REJECTION); a rejected reschedule also runs&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;cancelEventInSession&lt;br&gt;EventBudgetSummary.applyApproval(): creates or updates eventBudgets (the Mongo document stores&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;approvedByDecisionId); when every line has a fundingDecision, sponsoredItems are created&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(initialSponsoredItemStatus, initialPaymentChannel). 409: &quot;funded event changes require a finance&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;policy decision before reapproval&quot;, &quot;a legacy advance budget cannot be converted to sponsored item&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payments&quot;, &quot;a reschedule cannot change an already disbursed budget&quot;, &quot;approved budget cannot be&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;less than the amount already disbursed&quot;&lt;br&gt;EventDefenseSession.isActive(): applyProposalDecisionInSession() queries eventDefenseSessions in&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SCHEDULED | CONFIRMED | RESCHEDULE_REQUESTED | IN_PROGRESS itself (same set as domain&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;hasActiveDefense()); an active one blocks Approve / Reject / Re-defense (409); Re-defense needs a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;DEFENDED session without outcome (409 &quot;re-defense decision requires a completed defense session&quot;),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;which then gets the decision outcome" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="330" width="600" x="1340" y="682" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
