                <mxCell id="n2268" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EventPublishInput.validate(): domain validateEventPublication(input, startAt, endAt, now) -&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;409 &quot;event has already started&quot;; 400 &quot;registration must open before closing and close no later&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;than the start&quot; (also when only one of registrationOpenAt / registrationCloseAt is set);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;400 &quot;an event without registration must allow walk-ins&quot;; 400 &quot;invalid check-in window&quot;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(checkInOpenAt &amp;gt;= checkInCloseAt or checkInCloseAt &amp;gt; endAt)&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.publish(): mongo act(&quot;publish&quot;), one transaction: assertEventWriteAccess() (club-event-access),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;__v = expectedVersion (409 &quot;event changed or is not available in this club; reload and retry&quot;),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;state must be Approved (409 &quot;only approved events can be published&quot;),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;no Open EVENT_CANCELLATION approval task (409 &quot;event has a pending cancellation request&quot;),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;then publishInSession(state &quot;Upcoming&quot;): Approved -&amp;gt; Upcoming, publishedAt = now,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;new checkInCode, audit EVENT_PUBLISHED (notifyMembers is only used for state &quot;PUBLIC&quot;)&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.isRegistrationOpen(): usecase getEventRegistrationContext() (Upcoming | PUBLIC,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;registrationOpenAt &amp;lt;= now &amp;lt; registrationCloseAt, now &amp;lt; startAt)&lt;br&gt;ClubEventAction.eventActionPermission(): domain function eventActionPermission(action)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; &quot;club.event.manage&quot; (checked by assertClubAccess and again by assertEventWriteAccess)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
