                <mxCell id="n2750" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EventRegistrationContext.assertOpen(): usecase assertOpen() - state Upcoming | PUBLIC, inside the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;registration window and before startAt (409 &quot;event registration is not open&quot;); MEMBERS_ONLY without&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;an active membership -&amp;gt; 403 &quot;event is limited to active club members&quot;; a non-Cancelled registration&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; 409 &quot;student is already registered for this event&quot;&lt;br&gt;EventRegistrationContext.validateAnswers(): domain validateEventRegistrationAnswers(fields, answers);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;its errors become 400 validation; formSchema = formFields(payload.registrationForm) of the current version&lt;br&gt;EventRegistration.admit(): mongo register(), one transaction - Confirmed while&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;confirmedRegistrationCount &amp;lt; capacity (or policy allowOverbooking), else Waitlisted at&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;nextWaitlistPosition when waitlistEnabled; 409 &quot;event registration is no longer open&quot; (re-check),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;409 &quot;event capacity has been reached&quot;; a Cancelled registration document is reused; duplicate key 11000&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; 409 &quot;student is already registered for this event&quot;; audit EVENT_REGISTRATION_&amp;lt;STATE&amp;gt;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;notification EVENT_REGISTRATION_CONFIRMED | EVENT_REGISTRATION_WAITLISTED&lt;br&gt;EventRegistration.cancel(): usecase cancelEventRegistration() (404 not owned; 409 already Cancelled or event&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;started); mongo cancel(): 409 &quot;event registration cannot be cancelled&quot;, &quot;event has already started&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;event capacity counter is inconsistent&quot;; Cancelled, a freed Confirmed seat decrements the counter and&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;calls promoteEventWaitlist(); audit + notification EVENT_REGISTRATION_CANCELLED&lt;br&gt;context(): an unpublished event is not found (404) unless the student already has a registration" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
