        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CheckInTarget.checkInMethod(): usecase checkInToEvent() - Confirmed registration -&amp;gt; &quot;self&quot;; otherwise allowWalkIn -&amp;gt; &quot;walk-in&quot;;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;otherwise 403 &quot;a confirmed registration is required to check in&quot;&lt;br&gt;checkInToEvent() order of checks: target() null -&amp;gt; 404 &quot;event not found&quot;; existing attendance -&amp;gt; returned unchanged,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;alreadyCheckedIn = true (BR18); not published or state not in&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;checkInStates -&amp;gt; 409 &quot;event is not open for check-in&quot;; no checkInCode -&amp;gt; 409; code mismatch -&amp;gt; 400 &quot;invalid check-in code&quot;;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;outside window -&amp;gt; 409; MEMBERS_ONLY and not an Active member -&amp;gt; 403 &quot;event is limited to active club members&quot;&lt;br&gt;CheckInTarget[&quot;event&quot;].checkInWindow() / isWithinCheckInWindow(): domain checkInWindow() / isWithinCheckInWindow()&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(configured checkInOpenAt..checkInCloseAt, defaulting to startAt..endAt; open &amp;lt;= now &amp;lt; close)&lt;br&gt;CheckInTarget[&quot;event&quot;].codeMatches(): domain checkInCodesMatch() (trimmed, case-insensitive)&lt;br&gt;EventCheckInRepository.checkIn(): one transaction - re-checks attendanceFinalized != true, checkInStates, publishedAt, window, membership;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;self: registration must be Confirmed, else 403 &quot;a confirmed registration is required to check in&quot;;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;walk-in (only when not Confirmed): allowWalkIn else 409 &quot;walk-ins are disabled&quot;, capacity full and policy.allowOverbooking != true&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; 409 &quot;event capacity is full&quot;, registration created or set Confirmed + confirmedRegistrationCount + 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;attendance {method, abnormalFlags [&quot;walk-in&quot;] or []};&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;audit EVENT_CHECK_IN / EVENT_CHECK_IN_WALK_IN; EVENT_CHECKED_IN in-app notice; duplicate key (11000) -&amp;gt; created = false&lt;br&gt;Attendance.feedbackWindow(): domain feedbackWindow() (BR36) - opens at checkedInAt, closes eventEndAt + feedbackWindowHours&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(null when the effective policy has no window); listMine() skips no-show attendances" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" parent="1" vertex="1">
