        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source (mongo act() -&amp;gt; applyEventAttendanceAction(); audit EVENT_ATTENDANCE_&amp;lt;KIND&amp;gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.checkIn(): &quot;check-in&quot; (club.attendance.manage) - publishedAt set and state Upcoming / Ongoing / Completed (or legacy&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;PUBLIC / ONGOING / FINISH), attendance not finalized; outside the check-in window only club.event.manage holders may check in&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(403, checked before the duplicate test); already checked in -&amp;gt; no new attendance (audit EVENT_ATTENDANCE_CHECK-IN is still&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;written); outside the window a reason is required (400); inactive student -&amp;gt; 404; MEMBERS_ONLY non-member -&amp;gt; 403;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;not Confirmed -&amp;gt; walk-in needs allowWalkIn (409 &quot;confirmed registration is required&quot;), an effective policy (503 &quot;policy is not&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;configured&quot;) and a free seat unless policy.allowOverbooking;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;attendance method &quot;manual&quot;, abnormalFlags manual (+ out-of-window, + walk-in)&lt;br&gt;EventParticipant.correct(): &quot;correct&quot; - state Completed (or legacy FINISH) only; no attendance and no Confirmed registration -&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;404 &quot;participant not found&quot;; absent = true records a no-show (an existing&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;check-in cannot become a no-show); checkedInAt within [checkInOpenAt or startAt, endAt] and &amp;lt;= now; a check-in time with&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;submitted feedback is immutable; sets correctionReason (fixing a no-show needs checkedInAt)&lt;br&gt;EventParticipant.isResolved(): abnormalFlags empty or correctionReason set (unchecked Confirmed registrations show &quot;no-show&quot; after endAt)&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.finalizeAttendance(): &quot;finalize&quot; - state Completed (or legacy FINISH) and endAt &amp;lt;= now; every Confirmed registration has an&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;attendance and every flagged attendance is resolved, else 409 {studentIds}; attendances finalized (finalizedBy, finalizedAt),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;event.attendanceFinalized = true; legacy MEMBERS_ONLY event with no requested budget and no eventBudget: Completed -&amp;gt; Closed&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.unlockAttendance(): &quot;unlock&quot; - usecase requires system role ATTENDANCE_UNLOCK (403); 409 if a post-event report is&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Submitted / Accepted / Returned for correction; requires finalized attendance in Completed / Closed / FINISH; -&amp;gt; attendanceFinalized&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;= false, state Completed (FINISH stays FINISH), attendances un-finalized with unlockedBy / unlockReason&lt;br&gt;ClubEventAction.requiredPermission(): domain eventActionPermission() - check-in / unlock -&amp;gt; club.attendance.manage, otherwise&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;club.event.manage (unlock is authorized by ATTENDANCE_UNLOCK instead; act() re-checks it via assertEventWriteAccess)&lt;br&gt;Legacy FINISH (internal MEMBERS_ONLY) events pass the write guard only: act() commits, then readClubEvent() (audienceScope&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;PUBLIC&quot; filter) finds nothing and the response is 404 &quot;event not found&quot;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="1406" width="779" height="319" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
