        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.requestCancellation(): mongo act(&quot;cancel&quot;) on Approved / Upcoming / Ongoing - attendance not finalized;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;assertApprovedEventCancellationNotice(): startAt - now &amp;gt;= 72 h, else 409 &quot;cancellation request must be submitted at least 72 hours&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;before the event starts&quot;; no Open EVENT_CANCELLATION task (&quot;already pending ICPDP confirmation&quot;); creates approvalTasks&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;{entityType EVENT_CANCELLATION, state Open}; audit EVENT_CANCELLATION_REQUESTED; EVENT_CANCELLATION_REQUESTED to every&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ICPDP_OFFICER (queueNotifications). Event state is unchanged until ICPDP decides.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Legacy internal state DRAFT / CREATED / PUBLIC / ONGOING: cancelled at once by cancelEventInSession(source &quot;CMB&quot;); other states: 409.&lt;br&gt;EventCancellationRequest.decide(): mongoEventProposalReviewRepository.decideCancellation() - Open task required, not assigned to&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;another officer, event still in cancellableStates; task -&amp;gt; Decided (assigneeId = officer); approve -&amp;gt; cancelEventInSession(&quot;CMB&quot;, 24 h)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;+ audit EVENT_CANCELLATION_APPROVED; reject (reason required, usecase) -&amp;gt; event __v + 1 + audit EVENT_CANCELLATION_REJECTED;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;EVENT_CANCELLATION_DECIDED to club board (clubBoardUserIds). The request is read back from audit (eventCancellationRequest()).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;claim(): an Open EVENT_CANCELLATION task is claimed first - assigneeId = officer; held by another officer -&amp;gt; 409 &quot;event proposal&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;review is assigned to another officer&quot;&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.cancel(): cancelEventInSession() - -&amp;gt; Cancelled (legacy internal -&amp;gt; CANCELLED), confirmedRegistrationCount = 0,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;isLateCancellation = eventCancellationIsLate() only for source &quot;CMB&quot;; registrations Cancelled, open EVENT_PROPOSAL tasks Closed,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;active defense sessions CANCELLED, bookings released; non-sponsored budget only: Cancelled (nothing disbursed) or settlementDueAt&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;set (sponsored budgets untouched, audit marks sponsoredFinancePaused); audit EVENT_CANCELLED; EVENT_CANCELLED in-app notice&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;to Confirmed / Waitlisted registrants&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.isLateCancellation(): domain eventCancellationIsLate(startAt, now, noticeHours)&lt;br&gt;ClubEvent.reschedule(): act(&quot;reschedule&quot;) - Approved / Upcoming, attendance not finalized, no Open EVENT_CANCELLATION task&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(&quot;event has a pending cancellation request&quot;), no check-ins; occurrences shifted by the same offset, bookingIds cleared; assess() -&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Blocking Conflict = 409; linked bookings released (EVENT_RESCHEDULE); submitVersion(..., false) -&amp;gt; new revision Pending Approval&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(Under Review if a defense is active), new Open EVENT_PROPOSAL approvalTask (assigned to the defense lead when a defense is&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;active), audit EVENT_PROPOSAL_SUBMITTED; then audit EVENT_RESCHEDULED; EVENT_RESCHEDULED notice to Confirmed / Waitlisted registrants&lt;br&gt;Pending-cancellation guard: an Open EVENT_CANCELLATION task also blocks publish (&quot;event has a pending cancellation request&quot;)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and sponsored-item finance actions (&quot;event finance is paused ...&quot;).&lt;br&gt;ClubEventAction.requiredPermission(): domain eventActionPermission() -&amp;gt; club.event.manage" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="1510" width="779" height="371" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
