        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source (club workspace; every action locks the event with __v = revision, else 409 &quot;event changed; reload before continuing&quot;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;then no reporting obligation (event not Completed / Report Submitted / Closed) -&amp;gt; 409 &quot;event has no reporting obligation&quot;&lt;br&gt;authorized(): clubId -&amp;gt; assertClubAccess(club.report.submit); actOnPostEventReport(): club may only save / submit (403 otherwise),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;revision must be a non-negative integer; repository re-checks assertEventWriteAccess(club.report.submit) in the transaction&lt;br&gt;ReportInput.normalize(): domain normalizeReport() - actualResult required, texts &amp;lt;= 10000, &amp;lt;= 20 evidence items with HTTPS links&lt;br&gt;ReportObligation.assertSubmittable(): domain assertReportSubmission(state, attendanceFinalized, false) - event Completed and&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;attendance finalized, else 409 &quot;report requires completed event and finalized attendance&quot; (checked on both save and submit)&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport.save(): act(&quot;save&quot;) - latest Draft updated in place; no report or latest Returned for correction -&amp;gt; new Draft&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;version (versionNo + 1, preloadedFigures = preview); Submitted / Accepted -&amp;gt; 409 &quot;submitted report is immutable&quot;;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;accountabilityAudit(REPORT_SAVE) + REPORT_SAVE notice to the club board and the last submitter&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport.submit(): act(&quot;submit&quot;) - latest must be Draft (&quot;save a draft report before submitting&quot;); figures re-snapshotted&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and frozen, lateFlag = now &amp;gt; dueAt, state Submitted, event -&amp;gt; Report Submitted, openAccountabilityTask(POST_EVENT_REPORT)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(409 &quot;an open review task already exists&quot;); accountabilityAudit(REPORT_SUBMIT) + notice to the club board and the submitter&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport extends ReportInput (generalization): actualResult / incidents / lessonsLearned / evidence are report fields&lt;br&gt;ReportDetail: only events in Completed / Report Submitted / Closed (MEMBERS_ONLY without budget excluded); dueAt from&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;postEventDeadline() (policy POST_EVENT deadline, frozen with the first version); overdue = now &amp;gt; dueAt and nothing submitted;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;missing deadline config -&amp;gt; list() returns ReportConfigurationIssue. reportState: enum in infra/db/ucms-schema.generated.ts" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" parent="1" vertex="1">
