          <mxGeometry x="1185" y="1422" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m38" value="0..1&lt;br&gt;finding" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;" parent="1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="1275" y="1422" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source (ICPDP workspace; every action locks the event with __v = revision, else 409 &quot;event changed; reload before continuing&quot;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;then no reporting obligation -&amp;gt; 409 &quot;event has no reporting obligation&quot;; dueAt / overdue come from postEventDeadline() via detail()&lt;br&gt;ReportAction.assertValid(): usecase actOnPostEventReport() - authorized(): no clubId -&amp;gt; assertFinanceOfficer() (ICPDP_OFFICER, active);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;admin may only claim / decision / overdue (403 &quot;action not allowed for this workspace&quot;); reason 1..2000 required for decision and&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;overdue; outcome &quot;finding&quot; needs violationId (&quot;create a linked REPORT_FINDING case before accepting with finding&quot;).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Repository re-checks assertAccountabilityOfficer() in the transaction&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport.claim(): act(&quot;claim&quot;) - latest report Submitted (&quot;no report awaits review&quot;); claimAccountabilityTask(POST_EVENT_REPORT):&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Open task not assigned to another officer (&quot;review is assigned or unavailable&quot;) -&amp;gt; assigneeId = officer&lt;br&gt;PostEventReport.decide(): act(&quot;decision&quot;) - report Submitted and event Report Submitted; finding: violation with originType&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;REPORT_FINDING, originRefId = event, same club (else 400 &quot;linked report finding case is required&quot;); decideAccountabilityTask():&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;claimed by this officer (&quot;claim the review before deciding&quot;), approvalDecisions Approve (accept / finding) or Request revision&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(return), task Decided; report -&amp;gt; Accepted / Returned for correction (decisionOutcome, decisionReason, findingViolationId);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;event -&amp;gt; Closed (accept / finding) or Completed (return, club saves a new version)&lt;br&gt;ReportDetail.figuresAgree(): for accept / finding, attendance must be finalized and frozen confirmed / attended / absent must equal&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the live preview, else 409 &quot;attendance figures disagree; return the report for correction&quot;&lt;br&gt;ReportObligation.recordOverdue(): act(&quot;overdue&quot;) - only when overdue (now &amp;gt; dueAt, nothing submitted), else 409 &quot;report is not overdue&quot;;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;once per event (&quot;missing report already recorded&quot;); records audit REPORT_OVERDUE only (no violation case is opened here)&lt;br&gt;Every action: accountabilityAudit(REPORT_CLAIM / REPORT_DECISION / REPORT_OVERDUE) + same-code notice to the club board and the submitter" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="1648" width="833" height="254" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
