                <mxCell id="n6233" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every usecase first calls assertClubAccess(access, actor, clubId, &quot;club.report.submit&quot;, now);&lt;br&gt;mongo lock() re-checks it (assertEventWriteAccess) and needs club state Active | Suspended | Dissolving (409)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicDraftInput.normalize(): domain normalizePeriodicDraft(input, submitting = false, customFields?)&lt;br&gt;(submitting: &amp;gt;= 1 member with score 0-10, every event / achievement with evidence, every&lt;br&gt;required custom field answered; without structured parts: narrative, nextPlan, &amp;gt;= 1 evidence;&lt;br&gt;evidence = http/https link or data:image base64 up to 5 MB - isValidEvidenceLink())&lt;br&gt;AcademicSemester.periodicDueAt(): domain periodicDueAt(period, periodicDueDays(reportDeadlines));&lt;br&gt;due date = campaign.dueAt ?? periodicDueAt(...) (listClubPeriodicReports, createClubPeriodicReport);&lt;br&gt;both only consider calendar periods with startAt &amp;lt;= now; create rejects others (400 &quot;invalid reporting period&quot;)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicCampaign: latest PERIODIC_REPORT_CAMPAIGN_SAVED audit (findPeriodicCampaign)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicCampaign.acceptsSubmission(): createClubPeriodicReport() refuses (409) when no campaign / closed&lt;br&gt;or now &amp;gt; dueAt; mongo submit() refuses a closed campaign, a Draft after dueAt, a Returned report&lt;br&gt;after the resubmitDueAt of the latest PERIODIC_REPORT_RETURNED audit&lt;br&gt;mongo create(): one report per club + period (409), Draft, preloadedFigures.systemData, PERIODIC_REPORT_CREATED&lt;br&gt;PeriodicReportDetail.saveDraft() / submit(): mongo save()/submit() - only Draft or Returned for correction&lt;br&gt;at the expected revision (__v, else 409); save -&amp;gt; PERIODIC_REPORT_DRAFT_SAVED; submit re-runs&lt;br&gt;normalizePeriodicDraft(.., true, campaign.customFields), freezes live figures, state Submitted,&lt;br&gt;lateFlag = now &amp;gt; dueAt, versionNo + 1 on resubmission, opens the PERIODIC_REPORT approval task&lt;br&gt;(openAccountabilityTask), audit PERIODIC_REPORT_SUBMITTED, notifies ICPDP officers (PERIODIC_REPORT_SUBMITTED)&lt;br&gt;Club-entered members / events / achievements / customAnswers live in preloadedFigures.clubData&lt;br&gt;(save() merges them, submit() re-normalizes and freezes them); mongo detail reads clubData first,&lt;br&gt;falling back to systemData (members, events) computed by periodicSystemData()&lt;br&gt;PeriodicReportVersion.isReturned(): decision.outcome = &quot;Return&quot;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="332" width="600" x="1340" y="600" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
