                <mxCell id="n6646" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every usecase starts with officer(): authenticated (401), not Locked (423), auth.systemRoleCodes()&lt;br&gt;contains ICPDP_OFFICER (403)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicDecisionInput.normalize(): domain normalizedPeriodicDecision() - Accept may carry an&lt;br&gt;observation only; Return needs a reason and &amp;gt;= 1 section, resubmitDueAt is optional&lt;br&gt;PeriodicReportDetail.decide(): mongo decide() in a transaction - only Submitted (409 &quot;this report is not&lt;br&gt;waiting for a decision&quot;) -&amp;gt; Accepted | Returned for correction; closes the PERIODIC_REPORT approval&lt;br&gt;task (Decided), audit PERIODIC_REPORT_ACCEPTED | PERIODIC_REPORT_RETURNED (after.resubmitDueAt),&lt;br&gt;notifies the club board + submitter with the same code&lt;br&gt;decidePeriodicReport(): on Accept and when deps.evaluation is wired, calls evaluation&lt;br&gt;generateClubEvaluation(deps.evaluation, actor, clubId, periodCode, now) - a Data Ready draft;&lt;br&gt;a DomainError there is swallowed (the acceptance stays)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicReportRow.canRecordMissing(): usecase recordMissingPeriodicReport() - period in the calendar,&lt;br&gt;campaign not closed, dueAt &amp;lt;= now (409 otherwise); mongo recordMissing(): club exists, report not&lt;br&gt;Submitted/Accepted/Returned, no earlier PERIODIC_REPORT_MISSING (409); insertViolationCase()&lt;br&gt;opens an OVERDUE_REPORT violation (state Open, audit VIOLATION_OPENED), audit PERIODIC_REPORT_MISSING&lt;br&gt;on the club, notifies the club board (PERIODIC_REPORT_MISSING)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicOverview.defaultPeriod(): usecase periodicReportOverview() - latest ended semester, else the&lt;br&gt;first started one, else the first; dueAt = campaign.dueAt ?? periodicDueAt(period, dueDays)&lt;br&gt;PeriodicCampaign: savePeriodicCampaign() -&amp;gt; normalizedPeriodicCampaign() (&amp;lt;= 30 custom fields,&lt;br&gt;period in the academic calendar; 409 &quot;campaign configuration is not supported&quot; when repo.saveCampaign&lt;br&gt;is absent); mongo saveCampaign() appends a PERIODIC_REPORT_CAMPAIGN_SAVED&lt;br&gt;audit, moves Draft reports to the new dueAt, notifies club boards (PERIODIC_REPORT_OPENED) when open" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="318" width="600" x="1240" y="812" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
