                <mxCell id="k_ucmsModels_c7160" value="&lt;i&gt;«infra»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ucmsModels&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=48;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;fillColor=#ECEFF1;swimlaneFillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#37474F;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="p7155">
                    <mxGeometry x="30" y="40" width="170" height="211" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c7161" value="+violations : Model&lt;br&gt;+correctiveActions : Model&lt;br&gt;+auditLogs : Model&lt;br&gt;+notifications : Model&lt;br&gt;+clubs : Model&lt;br&gt;+users : Model&lt;br&gt;+events : Model&lt;br&gt;+eventBudgets : Model&lt;br&gt;+clubPositions, clubPositionAssignments,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; clubMemberships : Model (club board)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;rotatable=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" vertex="1" parent="k_ucmsModels_c7160">
                    <mxGeometry x="0" y="48" width="170" height="144" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c7162" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=#37474F;" vertex="1" parent="k_ucmsModels_c7160">
                    <mxGeometry x="0" y="192" width="170" height="8" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c7163" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;rotatable=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" vertex="1" parent="k_ucmsModels_c7160">
                    <mxGeometry x="0" y="200" width="170" height="11" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n7164" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every usecase starts with officer(): authenticated (401), not Locked (423), ICPDP_OFFICER via&lt;br&gt;auth.systemRoleCodes() (403); ids are checked as ObjectId (400)&lt;br&gt;ViolationCase.applyStep(): domain applyViolationStep(current, step, actorId, now) : StepResult&lt;br&gt;- the UC40 state machine (409 on a closed case):&lt;br&gt;investigate: Open -&amp;gt; Under Investigation (VIOLATION_INVESTIGATING)&lt;br&gt;addEvidence: any open state (VIOLATION_EVIDENCE_ADDED)&lt;br&gt;requestResponse: Open | Under Investigation -&amp;gt; Awaiting Club Response, due default 7 days&lt;br&gt;(RESPONSE_DUE_DAYS) (VIOLATION_RESPONSE_REQUESTED, notifies club)&lt;br&gt;recordResponse: Awaiting Club Response, not yet recorded -&amp;gt; VIOLATION_RESPONSE_RECORDED, or with noResponse&lt;br&gt;only after dueAt -&amp;gt; VIOLATION_NO_RESPONSE_RECORDED&lt;br&gt;decide NO_VIOLATION: refused (409 &quot;a decision has already been issued&quot;) only from Decision Issued |&lt;br&gt;Corrective Action -&amp;gt; Closed (VIOLATION_CLOSED_NO_VIOLATION); VIOLATION: needs&lt;br&gt;a recorded response + evidence -&amp;gt; Decision Issued (VIOLATION_DECIDED); reason required (BR28)&lt;br&gt;addActions: Decision Issued | Corrective Action -&amp;gt; Corrective Action, max 10 (VIOLATION_ACTIONS_ASSIGNED)&lt;br&gt;resolve: Decision Issued | Corrective Action, no Pending action -&amp;gt; Resolved (VIOLATION_RESOLVED)&lt;br&gt;mongo apply() runs it in a transaction (state compare-and-set, 409), inserts new corrective actions,&lt;br&gt;writes the audit (result.action) and, when notifyClub, notifies the club board with that code&lt;br&gt;mongo open(): club must exist (404), originRefId must be an event or budget of the club, state Open,&lt;br&gt;audit VIOLATION_OPENED&lt;br&gt;ViolationCase.isClosed(): finalStates = {Resolved, Closed}&lt;br&gt;ViolationSummary.responseOverdue (mongo list()): Awaiting Club Response, no response, responseDueAt passed&lt;br&gt;ClubResponse.record(): step &quot;recordResponse&quot; - NO_RESPONSE only after dueAt, else RECORDED_BY_ICPDP&lt;br&gt;CorrectiveAction.verify(): step &quot;verifyAction&quot; - case must be in Corrective Action, action Pending;&lt;br&gt;Verified needs the club's submission; Failed needs the submission or a passed dueAt;&lt;br&gt;VIOLATION_ACTION_VERIFIED | VIOLATION_ACTION_FAILED, or all Verified -&amp;gt; Resolved (VIOLATION_RESOLVED)&lt;br&gt;evidence: each addEvidence step appends one item (0..*); one call is capped at 20 (normalizedEvidence)&lt;br&gt;OVERDUE_REPORT cases are opened by recordMissingPeriodicReport() via insertViolationCase()&lt;br&gt;Club side (respond, submit action evidence): clubViolationRoutes / ClubViolationRepository" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1890" y="854" width="610" height="399" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
