                <mxCell id="n7767" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every usecase starts with officer(): authenticated (401), not Locked (423), ICPDP_OFFICER (403)&lt;br&gt;ClubMetrics.scoreDimensions(): domain scoreDimensions(metrics, scheme, periodCode, minRespondents)&lt;br&gt;(RULES D1..D8; a dimension without data is insufficientData, never 0) - but when&lt;br&gt;metrics.periodicReportOverdue.value &amp;gt; 0 every dimension gets score = computedScore = 0 with&lt;br&gt;justification &quot;Periodic report submitted late or not submitted by the deadline&quot;&lt;br&gt;MetricValue periodicReportOverdue = evaluationReportPenalty(): 1 when submittedAt &amp;gt; dueAt, or never&lt;br&gt;submitted, obligated and now &amp;gt; dueAt (dueAt = campaign.dueAt ?? report.dueAt ?? periodicDueAt())&lt;br&gt;DimensionResult.hasReportPenalty(): domain hasReportPenalty() - evidence has periodicReportOverdue &amp;gt; 0&lt;br&gt;EvaluationScheme.isActiveFor(): usecase activeScheme() / periodScheme() (BR51, BR60); no scheme -&amp;gt; 409&lt;br&gt;EvaluationScheme.activationIssues(): domain schemeActivationIssues()&lt;br&gt;generateEvaluations(): writeDraft(target new) -&amp;gt; Data Ready (EVALUATION_GENERATED) for each club&lt;br&gt;in scope without an evaluation of the period&lt;br&gt;generateClubEvaluation(): same for one club; returns silently when the period, scheme or club is&lt;br&gt;missing or the club already has an evaluation (no assertReportsReviewed)&lt;br&gt;EvaluationRecord.canRegenerate(): usecase regenerateEvaluation() - only the latest revision (409), state&lt;br&gt;in {Draft, Data Ready, Under Review} (target replace, EVALUATION_REGENERATED) or Published&lt;br&gt;(target revision, EVALUATION_REVISION_CREATED); writeDraft -&amp;gt; Data Ready&lt;br&gt;DimensionResult.keepManual(): usecase withManual() keeps an allowed manual score (UC42 A1),&lt;br&gt;not when the new results carry a report penalty&lt;br&gt;Precondition: assertReportsReviewed(repo, periodCode, now, clubId?) - 409 &quot;review the periodic reports&lt;br&gt;of this period first&quot; for any club whose report is still Submitted, unless reportPenalty().value &amp;gt; 0" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1350" y="0" width="600" height="305" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
