                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n8200" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity operations -&amp;gt; source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every usecase starts with officer(): authenticated (401), not Locked (423), ICPDP_OFFICER (403)&lt;br&gt;DimensionView.checkManualScore(): domain checkManualScore() - allowsManual (409),&lt;br&gt;0..100, justification required (UC43 FR-02); null clears the manual score and mongo setManual() restores&lt;br&gt;the computed score kept in the dimension evidence&lt;br&gt;setManualScore(): editable state only (409); 409 &quot;late or missing periodic reports require a zero&lt;br&gt;evaluation score&quot; when hasReportPenalty(dimensions) or reportPenalty().value &amp;gt; 0; mongo setManual()&lt;br&gt;-&amp;gt; Under Review, EVALUATION_MANUAL_SCORED | EVALUATION_MANUAL_CLEARED&lt;br&gt;EvaluationRecord.totalOf(): domain totalOf() - weights re-spread over scored dimensions; {} when none scored&lt;br&gt;EvaluationRecord.hasReportPenalty(): domain hasReportPenalty(dimensions) (periodicReportOverdue evidence)&lt;br&gt;SchemeThresholds.classify(): domain classify()&lt;br&gt;EvaluationDetail.isLatestRevision(): revisionNo = revisions[0].revisionNo - checked only by&lt;br&gt;regenerateEvaluation(); setManualScore / finalize / reopen check the state only&lt;br&gt;EvaluationRecord.finalize(): usecase finalizeEvaluation() - editable state (409), assertReportsReviewed(),&lt;br&gt;when penalized: regenerateEvaluation() first (all scores 0); total must be finite (409);&lt;br&gt;mongo finalize() recomputes the total in the transaction -&amp;gt; Finalized (EVALUATION_FINALIZED)&lt;br&gt;EvaluationRecord.reopen(): mongo reopen() - Finalized -&amp;gt; Under Review (EVALUATION_REOPENED)&lt;br&gt;EvaluationOverview.isPublishable(): canPublish - every club Finalized/Published with a total and &amp;gt;= 1&lt;br&gt;Finalized; publishEvaluations() re-checks each Finalized row: penalty must match hasReportPenalty and a&lt;br&gt;penalized total must be 0 (409 &quot;periodic report status changed; reopen and finalize the evaluation again&quot;),&lt;br&gt;then assertReportsReviewed(); mongo publish() re-checks in its transaction (409 &quot;finalize the evaluation of&lt;br&gt;every club before publishing&quot;, 409 &quot;an evaluation changed while publishing&quot;), moves all Finalized -&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;Published (EVALUATION_PUBLISHED) and notifies each club board (EVALUATION_PUBLISHED)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFF4;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1350" y="0" width="620" height="318" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e8201" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;strokeColor=#37474F;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.8667;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.1112;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="k_evaluationRoutes_c8153" target="k_UC_c8158">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="80.0" y="170.0" />
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c8202" value="1" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="125" y="167" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c8203" value="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1">
